{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36261","headline":"赠中岩王处士 · 方干","name":"赠中岩王处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂杨褭褭草芊芊，气象清深似洞天。\n援笔便成鹦鹉赋，洗花须用桔槔泉。\n商於避世堪同日，渭曲逢时必有年。\n直恐刚肠闲未得，醉吟争奈被才牵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}